<p>Good eye catching most of those, though some of them I can explain!</p>
<p>1. It’s not that it can only be used by researchers of Level-2 Clearance and lower, it’s that researchers of Level-2 Clearance and lower are restricted from using it.</p>
<p>2. Lifting from feels too informal, which is why I went with ceasing upon. This is a personal preference.</p>
<p>3. Because both rude actions and language to a degree of inappropriateness is bad to go through.</p>
<p>Otherwise, thank you for liking it!</p>
<p>Edit: Made a few corrections grammar-wise</p>

