<p>Overall, I quite like it, upvoted.</p>
<p>However, I would add a bit of exposition about exactly what happens when you first enter the hallucination. You are greeted by a 2541-1, who I assume tells you whats about to happen and allows you to leave if, say, you are a devout nun who stumbled upon this video by mistake?</p>
<p>Also, I would add somewhere before you get thrown into the orgy, a &quot;magic mirror&quot; which you can use to change your appearance. This prevents two problems. One, the poor 500&#160;lb former firefighter with hideous burn scars covering 50% of his body (including his face), crying in the corner because no one (understandably) wants to &quot;play&quot; with him. Two: Anonymity! To prevent you suddenly realizing, as you're about to orgasm from the wonderful oral sex you're receiving, that the older woman in the corner over there (who looked kind of familiar), making the increasingly loud and pleased sounding noises, is&#8230; YOUR MOM! Ick! Ick! Ick! :P.</p>
<p>Lastly, if, as seems likely, one gets told what the whole hallucination is about and is offered a speedy exit, then I would not label this as cognitohazardous. Maybe call it an anomalous cognitoeffect, rather than hazard?</p>

